@startuml
!include style.iuml
skinparam ConditionStyle InsideDiamond
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F5F8FC
skinparam activityBorderColor #475569
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF9E8
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #C4AC70
title Workflow of record-meal INDEX [date/YYYY-MM-DD] [s/SERVINGS]

start
:User enters\nrecord-meal INDEX [date/...] [s/...];
if (Valid\nINDEX and\nfields?) then ([no])
  :Reject with the\nrecord-meal usage line;
  stop
else ([yes])
endif
if (Any\nrecipes?) then ([no])
  :Reject: no recipes\nto record;
  stop
else ([yes])
endif
if (INDEX in\nrange?) then ([no])
  :Reject: index must be\nbetween 1 and N;
  stop
else ([yes])
endif
:Add an entry for the recipe\nat INDEX to the meal log;
:Show the recorded meal\nand the totals so far;
stop

legend bottom
  Valid: INDEX is one positive whole number, the date is real, not in the future and not before 1900, and servings are 1 to 100. In range: INDEX does not exceed the recipe count.
  A rejected command leaves the meal log unchanged.
endlegend
@enduml
